           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>Retime the keys on the selected object(s) — either a uniform time scale about a pivot, or a motion-aware speed normalization.

Option box: choose Uniform or Speed mode, whether Factor is a multiplier or an absolute target, how objects are grouped for pivots, and how scaled key times are snapped back to whole frames.</string>
           </property>
           <property name="text">
            <string>Scale Keys</string>
           </property>
           <property name="checkable">
            <bool>false</bool>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
